---
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Explorer from '../components/Explorer.astro';
---
<Layout><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> LIFE MOVES FORWARD. SO DO WE.</span><h1>For every<br/><em>next chapter.</em></h1><p>A home of your own. A growing family. A bigger dream.<br class="desktop"/> Whatever comes next, move forward with SAMA.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#explore">Find your service <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Let’s talk <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span class="tiny-shield">✓</span><span>Protection. Possibilities. Peace of mind.</span></div></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="/family.webp" alt="A family enjoying time together in a sunlit garden" width="1200" height="1000" fetchpriority="high"/><span class="photo-label">YOUR LIFE. YOUR POSSIBILITIES.</span><div class="photo-note"><span class="note-mark">↗</span><div>A little clarity.<br/><strong>A world of possibility.</strong></div></div></div></section><section class="intro-strip"><div class="wrap strip-inner"><p>Big decisions.<br/><strong>One familiar partner.</strong></p><div><strong>27</strong><span>services for life</span></div><div><strong>5</strong><span>ways to move forward</span></div><p class="strip-message">A personal approach to<br/>your financial world.</p></div></section><Explorer compact/><section class="approach" id="approach"><div class="wrap approach-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE SAMA APPROACH</span><h2>Life is complex.<br/>Your next step<br/><em>shouldn’t be.</em></h2><p>You don’t need to have it all figured out. Just a place to start, the right questions and someone to help make sense of the details.</p><a class="button light" href="/contact/">Start with a conversation ↗</a></div><div class="steps">{[['01','Your life comes first.','Tell us what matters to you, what’s changing and where you want to go.'],['02','Clarity before commitment.','Explore relevant options and understand the costs, conditions and questions worth asking.'],['03','Move at your own pace.','Choose your next step with guidance on the documents and process ahead.']].map(([n,h,p])=><div class="step"><span>{n}</span><div><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p></div></div>)}</div></div></section><section class="wrap featured"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THINKING ABOUT TOMORROW?</span><h2>Start with what<br/><em>matters today.</em></h2></div><p>A few good places to begin.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><a href="/products/term-plan/" class="feature red"><Icon name="term-plan" class="feature-icon"/><span>FOR THE PEOPLE YOU LOVE</span><h3>A future<br/>with them<br/>in mind.</h3><div>Explore term plans <b>↗</b></div></a><a href="/products/mutual-fund/" class="feature pale"><Icon name="mutual-fund" class="feature-icon"/><span>FOR THE GOALS YOU KEEP</span><h3>Small steps.<br/>Long-term<br/>possibilities.</h3><div>Explore mutual funds <b>↗</b></div></a><a href="/products/education/" class="feature ink"><Icon name="education" class="feature-icon"/><span>FOR THE DREAMS AHEAD</span><h3>Give ambition<br/>a place<br/>to grow.</h3><div>Explore education loans <b>↗</b></div></a></div></section><section class="wrap faq" id="questions"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE CLARITY</span><h2>Good questions.<br/><em>Honest answers.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask us something else ↗</a></div><div>{[['Where should I start?','Start with the goal you have in mind. Browse the service collection, or tell us what you’re working towards through the enquiry page.'],['Can I explore more than one service?','Yes. Your needs may span protection, borrowing, wealth and everyday services. You can mention multiple interests in your enquiry.'],['Does an enquiry commit me to a product?','No. An enquiry is a starting point for a conversation. Review the applicable terms and make a separate decision before purchasing or applying.'],['What should I prepare?','Each service page includes a short preparation checklist. You do not need to share sensitive documents in an initial enquiry.']].map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}<span>+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section><section class="closing wrap"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</span><h2>Let’s make room<br/>for <em>what’s next.</em></h2><a class="button" href="/contact/">Start a conversation ↗</a></section></Layout>
